{"task": "1 routine, region given", "q": "When should I harvest my soybean? I farm near Tamale.", "status": "pending_review", "priority": "routine", "clarification": "", "urgent_reasons": [], "sources": ["APNI-SARI-2023:harvest"], "source_checks": [["APNI-SARI-2023", true]], "errors": [], "draft_mode": "llm:mistralai/mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct", "language": "en", "citation_check": {"ok": true, "attempts": [{"draft_mode": "llm:mistralai/mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct", "ok": true, "problems": [], "figures_checked": 2, "sentences_checked": 3, "judge": {"model": "meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "verdicts": [{"n": 1, "sentence": "To determine when to harvest your soybean, look for 9 out of 10 pods to be mature, which means they should be brown in color or dry [APNI-SARI-2023:harvest].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023:harvest"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 2, "sentence": "Avoid leaving the crop in the field for too long, as this can cause the pods to become very dry and shatter during harvesting.", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023:harvest"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}, {"n": 3, "sentence": "For the best results, harvest early in the morning [APNI-SARI-2023:harvest].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023:harvest"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Matches passage"}]}}]}, "draft": "To determine when to harvest your soybean, look for 9 out of 10 pods to be mature, which means they should be brown in color or dry [APNI-SARI-2023:harvest]. Avoid leaving the crop in the field for too long, as this can cause the pods to become very dry and shatter during harvesting. For the best results, harvest early in the morning [APNI-SARI-2023:harvest].", "drafted_by": "model", "usage": {"attempted": 4, "calls": 4, "failed": 0, "errors": [], "by_role": {"draft": {"calls": 1, "prompt_tokens": 532, "completion_tokens": 100}, "judge": {"calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 1222, "completion_tokens": 136}, "farmer_text": {"calls": 1, "prompt_tokens": 270, "completio