"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Passages give options"}, {"n": 3, "sentence": "Make planting holes about 5 cm deep at the chosen spacing between holes [APNI-SARI-2023:p11-depth].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023:p11-depth"], "verdict": "not_supported", "why": "Adds chosen spacing"}]}}, {"draft_mode": "llm:mistralai/mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct", "ok": false, "problems": ["conflict on plant spacing (APNI-SARI-2023, IITA-SSPING-2022) is not shown: [APNI-SARI-2023:p11-spacing]'s own figure is not stated with its own citation", "conflict on plant spacing (APNI-SARI-2023, IITA-SSPING-2022) is not shown: [IITA-SSPING-2022:p17-spacing]'s own figure is not stated with its own citation", "'Make planting holes about 5 cm deep at the chosen spacing between holes .' is not supported by its citation according to the judge model: Spacing not chosen"], "figures_checked": 4, "sentences_checked": 3, "judge": {"model": "meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "verdicts": [{"n": 1, "sentence": "For soybean planting in Tamale, use a row-to-row spacing of 50 cm.", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023:p11-spacing", "IITA-SSPING-2022:p17-spacing"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Passages match", "sent_to_judge": "For soybean planting in the farmer's area, use a row-to-row spacing of 50 cm."}, {"n": 2, "sentence": "Choose either 15 cm or 10 cm spacing between plants in a row [APNI-SARI-2023:p11-spacing][IITA-SSPING-2022:p17-spacing].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023:p11-spacing", "IITA-SSPING-2022:p17-spacing"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Options given"}, {"n": 3, "sentence": "Make planting holes about 5 cm deep at the chosen spacing between holes [APNI-SARI-2023:p11-depth].", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023:p11-depth"], "verdict": "not_supported", "why": "Spacing not chosen"}]}}], "rejected_draft": "For soybean planting in Tamale, use a row-to-row spacing of 50 cm. Choose either 15 cm or 10 cm spacing between plants in a row [APNI-SARI-2023:p11-spacing][IITA-SSPING-2022:p17-spacing]. Make planting holes about 5 cm deep at the chosen spacing between holes [APNI-SARI-2023:p11-depth]."}, "draft": "[OFFLINE STUB DRAFT - no language model was used; text is assembled from retrieved passages]\nWhat the curated sources say:\n- \"The recommended plant spacing for soybean in northern Ghana is a row to row spacing of 50 cm and 15 cm spacing between plants in a row.\" [APNI-SARI-2023:p11-spacing]\n- \"This will allow the recommended spacing of 50 cm between rows (roughly the length of two footprints) and 10 cm between plants within the rows (roughly the length from the base of your thumb to the top of your index finger) to be applied and to achieve the required plant population.\" [IITA-SSPING-2022:p17-spacing]\n- \"To achieve the desired spacing, make planting holes that are about 5 cm deep at a spacing of 15 cm between holes.\" [APNI-SARI-2023:p11-depth]\nNote: Sources give different figures for plant spacing; officer should choose.\nNote: The model draft failed the citation check, so the verbatim passages are shown instead.", "drafted_by": "stub", "usage": {"attempted": 4, "calls": 4, "failed": 0, "errors": [], "by_role": {"draft": {"calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 1752, "completion_tokens": 200}, "judge": {"calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 1361, "completion_tokens": 143}}, "cost_usd": 0.000528}}
